id: pm-github-sah1
title: Stabilize the watchdog startup probe under concurrent coverage
description: The existing acceptance-watchdog test can reach its 500 ms synthetic-child deadline before the child prints ready under concurrent coverage. A full package run failed the ready assertion while the isolated watchdog suite passed 2/2. This is separate from the delivered bounded-consumer watchdog work in pm-github-hptv and from closeout behavior.
